{"ml_3_inch_mk_ii" "The Ordnance ML 3-inch mortar is an British 3-inch (in reality, 81.2 millimeter) calibre mortar. It was a successor to the Stokes mortar and while having an unsatisfactory initial range compared to its German counterparts, the weapon was improved throughout the war and became an effective infantry mortar."}
